Hi Susanta,

The StudioFX code is dependent on my jfxplot code ( https://github.com/brucejohnson/jfxplot ),, but I haven't uploaded it to any maven repositories yet (mostly because I haven't had time to figure out how).  So you need to clone and build the jfxplot (mvn clean install) so it's in your local repository, before trying to build StudioFX.

I'm busy with a couple of meetings this week.  When I'm free I'll try to replicate the above on a clean system (instead of my own Mac where lots of dependencies are already installed) and figure out uploading the code to a maven repository.

Thanks for your interest!

Bruc

