Hi Alex S,
Can you try this Vagrantfile: https://gist.github.com/akbertram/ed4257989eccc0a18e21f5bd2550e039

I've changed the base image to a 64-bit image and increased the available memory. I've verified that the latest version of Renjin builds on this VM.

If you run into problems, can you try without the synced folder and then checkout Renjin into the VM? Just to determine whether the problem relates to the synced folder / host filesystem or not.

Let me know!

Alex

On Mon, Jun 19, 2017 at 6:09 AM S. Alex Szebenyi <als...@gmail.com> wrote:

> Just wanted to bump my last question:
>
> Having trouble building Renjin the VM: has anyone else built Renjin on the VM lately? If passing, what host OS?  Detailed information on errors is in the last email.
>
> Thank you,
> Alex S.
